<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xml:id="lc-ol-introduction">
  <title>Introduction</title>
  <section xml:id="lc-ol-learning-outcomes">
    <title>Learning Outcomes</title>
    <p>Learning outcomes describe the knowledge, understanding, skills and values students should be able to demonstrate.</p>
    <p>This introduction presents the <em>Ordinary Level</em> learning outcomes from the Leaving Certificate Mathematics syllabus for examination from 2015. It does not list the additional Higher Level outcomes or the separate Foundation Level outcomes.</p>
  </section>
  <xi:include href="./lc-ol-statistics-outcomes.ptx"/>
